10:  * `CreateOperate` + `BoundingBoxMax (100, 100, 160)` + hidden - a lean box
11:  * (the width is 100 rather than 40; `LeanBoxObject` keeps 40). `MoveObject`
12:  * (:82-236): 8 (×1, the fountain `chofountain01`) `Velocity = 0.2`; the
13:  * lamps and fountain spray in `spec.ts`.
14:  *
15:  * Sound: `PlayWorldAmbientSounds` (SceneManager.cpp:623-628) plays `aWind`
16:  * *and* `aRain` here unconditionally, and `StopInactiveAmbientSounds` spares
17:  * both - it always rains in the market (`g_UnitedMarketPlace.CreateRain`),
18:  * so the world joins `OUTDOOR`. `PlayBGM` is commented out (:502-508): no
19:  * music, `null`.
