 37:  * hero comes back: tiles per tick for the slide, degrees per tick for the
 38:  * tumble. At `DECAY` 0.6 both are reached ~15 ticks after a full-strength
 39:  * kick, well inside the frame it visibly stops on.
 40:  */
 41: const SLIDE_AT_REST = 1e-4;
