 10: type BoneNode = BonedEmission['node'];
 11: 
 12: /**
 13:  * `b->TransformPosition(BoneTransform[N], p, Position)` for N = 15, 19, 21
 14:  * (ZzzObject.cpp:2907-2915), with the sprite scale each one is drawn at.
 15:  *
 16:  * The bone names in Object5/Object20.glb confirm the choice was deliberate:
 17:  * bone 15 is `light02`, bone 19 is `light01` and bone 21 is `Bone01`, the
 18:  * mount point at the machine's core - the two small emitters and the big one.
 19:  */
