32: /**
33:  * The vents. 77/78 are 204 emitters, and they do repeat - `rand_fps_check(6)`
34:  * with no `HiddenMesh` guard (:179-196) - so what keeps them off the screen
35:  * is the light the C++ gives them, `(0.04, 0.06, 0.03)` and
36:  * `(0.03, 0.03, 0.05)`. On an additive sprite that is a breath of colour over
37:  * the ground; the white they defaulted to before was 204 searchlights.
