 5:  * `<name>Layer` to `layers.ts`. Never imported; it only exists to be copied.
 6:  *
 7:  * Every entry has the same three parts, in this order:
 8:  *
 9:  *   1. Data at the top: worlds, tiles, spawn, sky kind - each with a comment
10:  *      saying where in the original it comes from.
11:  *   2. State + readers: a map entry has none of its own - its runtime state
12:  *      lives in the objects `create` binds (or in an event / sound entry).
13:  *   3. The exported `MapLayer` at the bottom.
