 12:  *     display value. All three files live under `Local/`; the paths below
 13:  *     are relative to `Data/`, and a wrong one is not a 404 but the SPA
 14:  *     fallback page, which decodes to garbage - hence the range checks.
 15:  *   - `Data/Local/<lang>/MasterSkillTooltip_<lang>.bmd` - 512 BUX records of 616
 16:  *     bytes (`_MASTER_SKILL_TOOLTIP_FILE`): seven printf strings per skill.
 17:  *   - `Data/Local/Skill.bmd` - 600 BUX records of 80 bytes: only the master
 18:  *     icon index, the use type and the base skill (`SkillBrand`) are read.
 19:  *
